[32m+[m[32m## Icon catalog[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe catalog uses this layout:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mdata/icons/<group>/*.svg[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe directory name becomes the group name, and `Favorites` is treated as the[m
[32m+[m[32mpreferred group. The icon name is derived from the SVG filename; an `mx_`[m
[32m+[m[32mprefix is removed. Users maintain their own catalog—WPT-Manager does not[m
[32m+[m[32mdistribute icons. Not every SVG from OsmAnd resources is necessarily usable as[m
[32m+[m[32ma waypoint icon in OsmAnd.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Data[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mApplication data is stored under `data/`. Collections and waypoints are stored[m
[32m+[m[32min the SQLite database `data/wpt_manager.db`. The database uses explicit schema[m
[32m+[m[32mversioning and UUIDs as stable identifiers for Collections and waypoints.[m
